  "description": "## 📜 𝕲𝖚𝖎𝖑𝖉 𝕹𝖊𝖜𝖘 📜\n\n🔸Event raid schedule: 3x day @ 6:05am, 6:35am, &amp; 7:05am UTC\n\n#### **𝕸𝖆𝖞 𝕲𝖔𝖉 𝖍𝖆𝖛𝖊 𝖒𝖊𝖗𝖈𝖞 𝖔𝖓 𝖙𝖍𝖊 𝖍𝖊𝖝𝖊𝖉.**\n\n## **• • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • •**\n\n#### The Faults of Exile **— Accepting applications**\n\n🔸No mandatory resource donations for Cursed and Banished players, Forsaken and other market characters encouraged to donate.\n\n🔸Raids twice daily at 6:05am + 7:10am (UTC).  All CL70, increasing with member level.\n\n🔸Lots of Guild Hall buildings, with weekly Energizing pool activation.\n\n🔸Near max Guild Hall for all the bonuses and buffs that come with it.\n\n🔸We are focused on leveling characters to increase raid levels and building the Guild Hall.  Planned additions: Teleport Beacon.\n\n###### Established April &#039;26 • • •\n###### discord.gg/wnEhRZFVfE",
